From 3ccaa2394cd1d65e3e2b25c2bfe72df174211eca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 3 ax <3axmail@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:05:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] refactor: cut the remaining Microsoft surface

- Remove the server --check-accounts flag; every Scoria server is offline.
- Drop the client --session-file/HORIZON_SESSION_FILE path: the game cannot be
  handed a Microsoft session, so online-mode servers are refused outright.
- Delete the Microsoft account doc; hosting, fork and agent docs say offline
  only. Clean the launcher README references.
- Keychain comments now name the friends token, its only user.
---
 crates/horizon-client/src/game.rs        | 17 +++--------------
 crates/horizon-client/src/game/extras.rs |  2 +-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

